WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.030
DS-1000 contains a thousand problems originating
from four hundred fifty-one unique StackOverflow posts,

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:12.499
spanning seven widely used Python libraries: NumPy,
Pandas, TensorFlow, PyTorch,

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:14.960
SciPy, Scikit-learn, and Matplotlib.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:20.840
More than half of the problems are modified from
their sources to resist memorization,

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:24.531
including one hundred fifty-two surface perturbations,

00:00:24.611 --> 00:00:27.744
two hundred thirty-five semantic perturbations,

00:00:27.824 --> 00:00:30.821
and one hundred sixty-two difficult rewrites.

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:36.153
On average each problem has one point six test
cases, one hundred forty words,

00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:39.571
and a reference solution of three point six lines,

00:00:39.651 --> 00:00:43.195
and about one in five carry surface-form constraints.

00:00:43.275 --> 00:00:46.408
With a hundred forty average words per problem,

00:00:46.488 --> 00:00:50.920
DS-1000 is far richer in context than other data
science datasets.
